# Yaqeen Mobile UX/UI Revamp (React Native + TypeScript)

This repository contains a production-ready revamp starter for the Yaqeen educational application focused on:

- Arabic-first RTL mobile UX
- Reusable atomic design system
- 26-screen flow coverage
- Enrollment conversion improvements
- Accessibility baseline (WCAG 2.1 AA aligned patterns)

## Tech Stack

- Framework: React Native (TypeScript)
- State Management: Zustand
- Design Architecture: Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms -> Templates -> Screens

## Directory Structure

```text
/components
  /atoms
  /molecules
  /organisms
  /templates
/screens
/styles
  /theme
  /rtl
/utils
  /i18n
  /navigation
/store
/docs
```

## Implemented Revamp Scope

- Design tokens: colors, typography, spacing, shadows
- Core reusable components requested in prompt
- 26 screen definitions and Arabic content mapping
- Empty states with actionable CTAs
- Itemized payment summary (subtotal + VAT + total)
- RTL initialization and right-aligned content defaults

## Scripts

- `npm run start`
- `npm run android`
- `npm run ios`
- `npm run typecheck`

## Notes

- This starter focuses on the revamp architecture and screen/component coverage.
- Integrations such as analytics providers and payment gateway SDKs are intentionally abstracted and should be connected in implementation phase.